---
/* ============================================================
   Bearings — SheetConstellation (on /between)

   A quiet visual pointer back to the planning sheets, drawn as a
   three-star constellation. Deliberately NOT card content: the
   `between` shelf is capped at zero authored cards by a locked
   decision (PRODUCT_BOUNDARY.md) — writing advice for someone
   mid-experience is a different kind of artifact. Navigation to
   tools that already exist is not advice; it is a reminder that
   the planning a person made earlier is still where they left it.

   Pure SVG + CSS: no hydration, no JS, no storage. Works before
   any island loads and with scripts disabled entirely. Drift
   animation is decorative only and switches off under both the
   system preference and the in-app motion toggle.
   ============================================================ */
---

<div class="constellation">
  <div class="c-copy">
    <p class="c-head">Made plans earlier?</p>
    <p class="c-sub">
      They are where you left them. None of it expires, and nothing here
      needs doing right now.
    </p>
  </div>

  <svg
    viewBox="0 0 640 210"
    class="sky"
    role="img"
    aria-label="Three linked points: the preparation worksheet, the session focus worksheet, and the integration worksheet"
  >
    <line x1="122" y1="118" x2="318" y2="66" class="thread"></line>
    <line x1="322" y1="66" x2="518" y2="126" class="thread"></line>

    <a href="/sheet/preparation" class="node n1">
      <circle cx="120" cy="120" r="20" class="halo"></circle>
      <circle cx="120" cy="120" r="7" class="star"></circle>
      <path d="M120 104 v-8 M120 136 v8 M104 120 h-8 M136 120 h8" class="spark"></path>
      <text x="120" y="162">Preparation</text>
    </a>

    <a href="/sheet/session-focus" class="node n2 deep">
      <circle cx="320" cy="64" r="20" class="halo"></circle>
      <circle cx="320" cy="64" r="7" class="star"></circle>
      <path d="M320 48 v-8 M320 80 v8 M304 64 h-8 M336 64 h8" class="spark"></path>
      <text x="320" y="106">Session focus</text>
    </a>

    <a href="/sheet/integration" class="node n3">
      <circle cx="520" cy="128" r="20" class="halo"></circle>
      <circle cx="520" cy="128" r="7" class="star"></circle>
      <path d="M520 112 v-8 M520 144 v8 M504 128 h-8 M536 128 h8" class="spark"></path>
      <text x="520" y="170">Integration</text>
    </a>
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .constellation {
    max-width: var(--measure);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: var(--space-4);
  }
  .c-head {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--size-lg);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-1);
  }
  .c-sub {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: var(--size-sm);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-2);
  }
  .sky {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }
  .thread {
    stroke: var(--grid-line);
    stroke-width: 1;
    stroke-dasharray: 2 5;
    fill: none;
  }
  .node {
    cursor: pointer;
    outline-offset: 4px;
  }
  .star {
    fill: var(--gold);
    transition: fill 0.25s ease;
  }
  .spark {
    stroke: var(--gold);
    stroke-width: 1;
    opacity: 0.55;
    transition: opacity 0.25s ease;
  }
  .halo {
    fill: transparent;
    stroke: transparent;
    transition: all 0.25s ease;
  }
  .node text {
    fill: var(--ink-soft);
    font-family: var(--font-meta);
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-anchor: middle;
    transition: fill 0.25s ease;
  }
  /* Deep-work node carries the garnet register, matching /learn. */
  .node.deep .star {
    fill: var(--garnet);
  }
  .node.deep .spark {
    stroke: var(--garnet);
  }
  .node:hover .star,
  .node:focus-visible .star {
    fill: var(--gold-bright);
  }
  .node.deep:hover .star,
  .node.deep:focus-visible .star {
    fill: var(--garnet);
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 6px var(--garnet));
  }
  .node:hover .halo,
  .node:focus-visible .halo {
    stroke: var(--rule);
    fill: var(--garnet-wash);
  }
  .node:hover text,
  .node:focus-visible text {
    fill: var(--gold-bright);
  }

  /* Decorative drift, three phases so the constellation breathes
     rather than bounces. Off whenever anyone says slow down. */
  .n1 { animation: drift 11s ease-in-out infinite alternate; }
  .n2 { animation: drift 13s ease-in-out -4s infinite alternate; }
  .n3 { animation: drift 12s ease-in-out -8s infinite alternate; }
  @keyframes drift {
    from { transform: translateY(0); }
    to { transform: translateY(-5px); }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .n1, .n2, .n3 { animation: none; }
  }
  :global([data-motion="reduce"]) .n1,
  :global([data-motion="reduce"]) .n2,
  :global([data-motion="reduce"]) .n3 {
    animation: none;
  }
</style>
